---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Utility Work" description="Public right-of-way work, directional boring and utility-side construction to PG&E, SCE, SDG&E, LADWP and municipal standards." path="/utility/">
<section id="utility"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <p class="label">Utility</p>
    <h1>Full utility work, all over California.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Public right-of-way work, directional boring and utility-side construction built to PG&amp;E, SCE, SDG&amp;E, LADWP and municipal utility standards. We build the utility side and the customer side, so the service is ready when the utility shows up to energize.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cgrid">
    <figure class="lead"><img src="/u-vault.jpg" alt="SCE precast vault set in the excavation with forms built around it" loading="lazy"><figcaption>SCE vault set and formed</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="tall"><img src="/u-busl.jpg" alt="PG&amp;E bus duct and service section assembled on site" loading="lazy"><figcaption>PG&amp;E bus duct</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="third"><img src="/u-sce.jpg" alt="SCE pad-mount transformer on a new pad with the Edison vault lid in front" loading="lazy"><figcaption>SCE transformer, pad and vault</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="third"><img src="/u-abb.jpg" alt="Pad-mount transformer on a new concrete pad beside a public street" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Pad-mount transformer at the street</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="third"><img src="/u-switch.jpg" alt="Utility pad-mounted switch set beside a sidewalk" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Utility switch on pad</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="half"><img src="/u-vault2.jpg" alt="Formed SCE vault in an open excavation inside a fenced site" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Vault formed for the pour</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="half"><img src="/u-garage.jpg" alt="Transformer set in a parking structure next to the main switchgear" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Transformer in a parking structure</figcaption></figure>
  </div>
  <ul class="ugfacts" aria-label="Utility scope">
    <li>Public right-of-way work</li><li>Directional boring</li><li>Points of interconnection</li><li>Potholing and utility locating</li><li>Traffic control and street restoration</li><li>Transformer and switch pads with vaults</li><li>Bus duct and service sections</li><li>Utility coordination through energization</li>
  </ul>
</div></section>

<div class="ctaband"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Have a plan set? We'll price it.</h2>
  <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Request a bid</a>
</div></div>
</Base>
